  "full_response": "# **Developer Onboarding: API Keys & Access Tokens Guide**\n\nWelcome to the team! This document lists all the API keys, access tokens, and credentials you’ll need to set up your development environment. **Never commit real keys to version control**—always use environment variables or a secure secrets manager.\n\n---\n\n## **1. Required API Keys & Tokens**\nReplace the sample values (`your_actual_key_here`) with the real keys provided by your team lead or obtained from the respective service dashboards.\n\n### **1.1. Core Services**\n| Service          | Key Name               | Sample Value (Replace) | Where to Get It |\n|------------------|------------------------|------------------------|-----------------|\n| **GitHub**       | `GITHUB_TOKEN`         | `ghp_abc123...`        | [GitHub Personal Access Token](https://github.com/settings/tokens) |\n| **AWS**          | `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`    | `AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE` | AWS IAM Console |\n| **AWS**          | `AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`| `wJalrXUtnFEMI/K7MDENG/bPxRfiCYEXAMPLEKEY` | AWS IAM Console |\n| **AWS**          | `AWS_REGION`           | `us-east-1`            | AWS Console |\n| **Stripe**       | `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`    | `sk_test_51AbCdEf...`  | [Stripe Dashboard](https://dashboard.stripe.com/test/apikeys) |\n| **Stripe**       | `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`| `whsec_xyz123...`      | Stripe Webhook Settings |\n\n### **1.2. Third-Party APIs**\n| Service          | Key Name               | Sample Value (Replace) | Where to Get It |\n|------------------|------------------------|------------------------|-----------------|\n| **Twilio**       | `TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID`   | `ACabc123...`          | [Twilio Console](https://console.twilio.com/) |\n| **Twilio**       | `TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN`    | `abc123...`            | Twilio Console |\n| **SendGrid**     | `SENDGRID_API_KEY`     | `SG.abc123...`         | [SendGrid API",
